{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0303_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0b80ab7ff983864b8515686ce636aa4054174e73fb0c5a4ddf6e88536a5539a4", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影は順調だ。\n伊織がウェイトレスとして働く姿を撮っている）", "zh": "（写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄进行得很顺利。\n现在正在拍摄伊织作为女服务员工作的模样。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0303_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "9506fb76affabc3bf068fcb9fc235397f346ec32e79fa26343670aff23f78af9", "ja": "ふぅ……いったん休憩ね。{$P$}、\n私のウェイトレス姿、どうかしら？", "zh": "呼……先休息一下吧。{$P$}，我当女服务员的样子，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0303_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b9cf09ebcce6fe69f6fd6c47c6e45e286d4ff5f32c2b17ebb104ceaf7c84a163", "ja": "お疲れ様、伊織。もちろん素敵だったよ。\n見た目だけじゃなく、仕事も手際が良くて驚いたな。", "zh": "辛苦了，伊织。当然很棒啊。\n不只是外表漂亮，工作也做得很利落，真让我吃了一惊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0303_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "bcf6e0c2ffc63c142bebf065f127002c5ca8d6cd4925309b3f42f6d3b005f5cf", "ja": "ふふん、もっとほめてもいいのよ？\n自分でもうまくできたって思ってるんだから！", "zh": "哼哼，还可以再多夸夸我哦？  \n我自己也觉得做得很不错呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0303_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9c001d9c5372a3cd6c99b6daa225c6fb0186ca476fb3d32696d171e91907ec01", "ja": "ああ。お皿の持ち方から提供のマナーまで完璧\nだったよ。とてもその場で覚えたとは思えなかったぞ。", "zh": "啊。从拿盘子的方式到上菜礼仪，全都无可挑剔。\n真让人难以相信你是当场学会的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0303_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "7df491fed569a016e5cf65365ba6c93fdbb237dfefbb7065a7c61c14a168a9ab", "ja": "それはもちろん、伊織ちゃんの才能……でもあるけど、\n実は新堂のおかげ、が大きいのよね。", "zh": "这当然也是伊织的才能……不过，其实更大程度上还是多亏了新堂。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0303_1006_p", "source_sha256": "97ef0cf32f4b464282ce646669ab1f0ada526a07cab416eb27c8e7ec83552413", "ja": "新堂って……ああ、伊織の家で執事をしている、\nあの新堂さんのことか。", "zh": "你说的新堂……啊，是在伊织家担任管家的那位新堂先生吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0303_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "13434c643e7edf3bb48f2855a6fede59dff7bf542a860e86966322fe783ae6de", "ja": "そうよ。新堂にはいつも紅茶を淹れてもらってるから、\nそれとなくコツを聞いてみたの。本当にそれとなくよ。", "zh": "对啊。我平时总让新堂帮我泡红茶，所以就旁敲侧击地向他请教了一下诀窍。真的只是旁敲侧击哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0303_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "308e293291a0261cf77e88e433ca672d361b3201790e20dc73d4a769e4744960", "ja": "なのに新堂ったら、はりきっちゃって。ティーセットを\n並べて、手取り足取りアドバイスしてくれたの。", "zh": "可新堂却一下子来劲了。还摆好茶具，手把手地给我提了建议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0303_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f34fd2a79fa69a4a7109a71b0574589a29b15449f05c29769cc84c5bb51fc547", "ja": "はは、そうだったのか。きっと新堂さん、\n伊織に頼られて嬉しかったんだろうな。", "zh": "哈哈，原来是这样。新堂先生一定是因为受到伊织的依赖而感到高兴吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0303_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "2edc092a637676976c1d5bd7d872f90d220d959c3b6887e550005ce822140ec5", "ja": "まあ、そうかもしれないわね。\n熱心すぎて、かなりスパルタだったけど……。", "zh": "也许是那样吧。\n虽然她太热情了，练得相当斯巴达就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0303_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "2a86b64fb8899bd233c6de5f18c86f780b9b173c5a6548655ab7a1d1031f4ad4", "ja": "でも、おかげで、新堂から教わったことは全部、\nしっかり見せられたと思うわ。", "zh": "不过，多亏了这样，我觉得自己已经把从新堂那里学到的东西，全都好好展示出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0303_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5b96d013c997f57117013057371fc4cbd8ab679d8f43c6fcb7255362b3bc4eda", "ja": "それは何よりだ。新堂さんのアドバイスと伊織の努力、\n二人の頑張りのおかげで、上手くいったってわけだな。", "zh": "那就再好不过了。多亏了新堂先生的建议和伊织的努力，才能顺利完成。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0303_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "9ad3a37dae33221e9d613ba58dc81dcd1feac3eadcb1045a6ed23f2e6dbbee3d", "ja": "ええ。だから、今日の写真は\n新堂にも見せてあげなくちゃね。ふふっ♪", "zh": "嗯。所以，今天拍的照片也得给新堂看看才行呢。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0303_1014_p", "source_sha256": "25a83f6fc48658cf2282b33a8e4ee8cf3a4f010939454e1e714d2d597029c939", "ja": "そうだな。残りの撮影も心配いらなそうだし、\n俺は引き続き、ゆっくり見学させてもらうよ。", "zh": "是啊。剩下的拍摄似乎也不用担心了，我就继续在旁边慢慢参观吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0303_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "003b4b7bfb0a04c939a53fba3ce3d206b44af6ebbbef7a7182ba072165279c89", "ja": "あら、そうはさせないわよ？　アンタには\n大事なお仕事をしてもらうんだから。はい、これ。", "zh": "哎呀，我可不会让你得逞哦？\n因为你还有重要的工作要做呢。喏，拿去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0303_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7b305254f2fdd2bf4868f1c3d4a86aeb1940bd0c83d102d947f6c0c8771c8d69", "ja": "ん？　なんだ、この分厚いノートは？　ええと……\n『新堂直伝！　最高の紅茶の淹れ方』？", "zh": "嗯？这本厚厚的笔记本是什么？呃……\n《新堂亲授！泡出顶级红茶的方法》？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0303_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "c0cd51b2a798ca0dd370d2894f621a37098180f0a4a7efcabd6278a3433ce950", "ja": "伊織ちゃんが最高のお仕事をしてくるんだから、\n最高の紅茶でねぎらってくれてもいいんじゃない？", "zh": "既然伊织会完成最棒的工作，用最棒的红茶慰劳我一下也没什么不好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0303_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "c50214ef7804d850b83e6076d248d64a91ba5cb2dc3dae03c785be4e4b94c605", "ja": "それじゃ、私は撮影に戻るから。アンタの淹れた\nおいしい紅茶、楽しみにしてるわよ？　にひひっ♪", "zh": "那么，我要回去拍摄了。很期待你泡的美味红茶哦？嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0303_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0303_1019_p", "source_sha256": "13c6e625adcda947336b30bb0a87b80f4f0edc5ad854fcb46aa3fce310ea4693", "ja": "（よ、よし。最高の仕事をしてくれた伊織のためにも、\n最高の紅茶を淹れないとな……。えーとまずは……）", "zh": "（好、好。为了给表现最棒的伊织泡上一杯最棒的红茶，我可得好好准备才行……。呃，首先是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
